   "widgets_values": [
    "Required models (LOCAL — already on disk):\n\nMOSS Image DiT:  D:/ComfyUiCuda/models/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors\nText Encoder:    C:/ai_diffusion/models/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors  (type: moss_image)\nVAE:             C:/ai_diffusion/models/vae/flux2_vae.safetensors\nTurbo LoRA:      MOSS/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd.safetensors  -> loras/MOSS/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd.safetensors\n\nAll loaders point to files that exist locally. Generation runs at 8 steps / CFG 1.0 via the Turbo (DMD) LoRA."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "Required models for Moss Image Workflow:\n\nMoss Image Model: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/tree/main/diffusion_models\nText Encoder: https://huggingface.co/prithivMLmods/Qwen3.5-9B-Uncensored-ComfyUI/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors\nVAE: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/tree/main/vae\n\nint8 convrot gives x3 faster boost speed\nUse SFT model for generation\n\nFile save location\n\nComfyUI/\n├───📂 models/\n│   ├───📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├─── moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 loras/\n│   │   ├─── Any loras if you want for flux 2 klein 9b\n│   ├───📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └───📂 vae/\n│       └── flux2_vae.safetensors \n"
